  "sandbox_stdout": "Parent: n=768, score=1.505008\n=== Phase 1: Diverse Initializations ===\n  Top 3 inits: ['1.5050 (parent)', '2.0000 (flat_832)', '2.0000 (flat_704)']\n\n=== Phase 2: Smooth-Max Gradient Descent ===\n  SMD on parent (n=768): t=120s\n  SMD on flat_832 (n=832): t=120s\n  SMD on flat_704 (n=704): t=120s\n\n=== Phase 3: Mirror Descent ===\n  MD on best (n=768): t=150s\n\n=== Phase 4: LP-FW Optimization ===\n  LP-FW on best (n=768): t=180s\n  NEW BEST [lpfw]: 1.505006 (n=768)\n\n=== Phase 5: Length Exploration ===\n  SMD n=704: t=80s\n  SMD n=832: t=80s\n\n=== Phase 6: Alternating Peak Reduction ===\n  APR on best (n=768): t=80s\n\n=== Phase 7: LP-FW with Perturbations ===\n  LP-FW variant 0: t=60s\n  LP-FW variant 1: t=60s\n  LP-FW variant 2: t=60s\n  LP-FW variant 3: t=60s\n\n=== Phase 8: Final MD Polish ===\n  Final MD: t=40s\n\n=== Phase 9: Final LP-FW Squeeze ===\n  Final LP-FW: t=20s\n\nFINAL SCORE: 1.505006 (n=768)",
